      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "When it runs",
      "items": [
        "The engine writes the draft at the end of its daily run (hour set in /admin)",
        "The cron posts from the hour set in /admin/social, once per Vietnam day",
        "Without a draft the cron writes one first; no picks means no post"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Never twice",
      "items": [
        "The claim moves draft to posting, so only one caller can post it",
        "A failure is stored on the row; nothing retries on its own",
        "Post now in /admin/social retries a draft or failed post"
      ]
    },
